    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2e688389",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image features a smiling man with a shaved head, wearing a dark jacket over a blue shirt, set against a plain background. The text overlay reads, 'when you don't need a squad be you are the squad.' This meme uses the visual of a confident, self-assured individual to convey the message that one can be their own support system or 'squad' without needing others. The overall intent is to promote self-reliance and self-sufficiency in a lighthearted, motivational way. There is no toxicity present in this meme; it does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The intent is to encourage personal empowerment and independence through the analogical mapping of the individual's confident demeanor to the idea of being one's own support group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cee6adbe"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
