      "description": "The central visual material is a man with a closely shaved head, blue eyes, and a warm smile. He is wearing a dark jacket over a blue collared shirt. His confident and self-assured expression is the primary visual element used to convey the meme's message of self-reliance. The man appears to be in a formal or semi-formal setting, possibly at an event, given the plain background and his attire.",
