      "label": "self_reliance_meme",
      "description": "A scene depicting a confident man with a shaved head, smiling and wearing a dark jacket over a blue shirt, symbolizing self-reliance. The text overlay reinforces the message that one can be their own 'squad' without needing others. The scene is composed of the man as the central visual element, with the text serving as a complementary narrative component.",
