      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "motivational meme audience",
      "description": "The target community is individuals seeking personal empowerment, self-reliance, and motivational content, particularly those engaged with social media trends around 'squad' culture and self-confidence. The meme appeals to a broad demographic interested in positive affirmations and self-improvement, using relatable imagery (James McAvoy as a confident figure) and colloquial language ('squad') to resonate with users who value independence and emotional resilience.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
